Description: mount a remote account as an on-demand FUSE filesystem
 Cloud Fuse mounts a Google Drive or Cloud Server account as an on-demand,
 read-write FUSE filesystem.  This package contains the daemon, the
 cloud-fuse command-line client, and the terminal user interface.
 .
 The package installs the cloud-fuse@.service template unit but enables no
 Instance.  Create one with "cloud-fuse setup <account>".

